**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
cdk.out
**/cdk.out
# ROOT-ANCHORED on purpose. Bare `docs` / `*.md` also matched NESTED paths,
# which silently deleted the in-app documentation feature from the image:
# `frontend/src/app/(app)/docs/` (the route) and `frontend/src/content/docs/*.md`
# (its content) never reached the Docker context, so Next just built 21 routes
# instead of 22 — no error, because lib/docs.ts is imported only by that route.
# Found live: /docs returned 404 in production while passing locally (S16 deploy).
/docs
/.kiro
/*.md
!sample-app/template.json
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
.auth-secret
# Local-only material. No Dockerfile COPYs any of it; this keeps it out of the
# docker build context (local builds and CodeBuild). The CodeBuild SOURCE zip is
# a separate CDK S3 asset whose exclude list lives in infra/lib/build-stack.ts —
# keep the two lists in step.
.origin-verify
/private
/.agents
/.worktrees
/scripts/*.local.sh
/scripts/*.local.txt
/scripts/*.bak
